From: catawalks <59056948+catawalks@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: PJ4B 88PA61x0: erratum 6011 (five LDREX, IRQs off for the loads)

Test options for the DP200 nandboot hangs, off by default
(docs/kernel/nandboot_hang_analysis.md).
---
